ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a well-known research institution, researcher Allen carelessly sends confidential information to external personnel. Intern Kate, realizing this mistake, decides not to tell her superiors to protect the reputation of the institution. At the same time, senior engineer Mark knows that Kate knows about this leak, but he chooses to remain silent because he has a personal grudge against Allen and wants to see Allen get into trouble. When the leak of confidential information causes significant damage to the institution, Allen feels very shocked and regretful. Later, Kate realizes that she probably should report this incident earlier.\n\n[Question]\nKate knows about the leak of confidential information but does not tell her superiors, what kind of emotion does she feel?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Kate probably feels worried, afraid of being punished for reporting.\nB. Kate probably feels confused, unsure whether she should tell her superiors.\nC. Kate probably feels anxious and guilty, because she realizes that her silence may lead to more serious consequences.\nD. Kate probably feels satisfied, because she thinks this protects the reputation of the institution.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007577243060727413,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a7dc2ddb05a7fe2e2f6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452093098,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:54:53","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"fi